WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.125 --> 00:00:08.250
You’re the Witcher.

00:00:08.250 --> 00:00:09.791
I love the way you just

00:00:09.791 --> 00:00:11.625
sit in the corner
and brood.

00:00:11.958 --> 00:00:13.291
You smell of death

00:00:13.291 --> 00:00:14.625
and destiny.

00:00:14.833 --> 00:00:16.666
Heroics and...

00:00:16.666 --> 00:00:18.083
heartbreak.

00:00:18.083 --> 00:00:19.500
It’s onion.

00:00:19.958 --> 00:00:21.000
Right, yeah.

00:00:22.250 --> 00:00:23.875
I’m here to drink alone.

00:00:23.875 --> 00:00:25.291
Right, so stick close to me,

00:00:25.291 --> 00:00:26.666
look mean and
pretend you're a mute.

00:00:26.666 --> 00:00:28.541
Can't have anyone finding out
who you actually are.

00:00:28.541 --> 00:00:30.166
Geralt of Rivia!

00:00:30.166 --> 00:00:32.416
The mighty Witcher!

00:00:32.416 --> 00:00:33.333
Oh shit.

00:00:33.625 --> 00:00:34.375
Come here.

00:00:34.375 --> 00:00:35.000
Yeah?

00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:37.125
I’m not your friend.

00:00:38.541 --> 00:00:40.083
Oh, are we not using 'friend'?

00:00:40.625 --> 00:00:43.083
Yeah sure, let's just give it
another decade.

00:00:43.083 --> 00:00:44.833
You have the most
incredible neck.

00:00:45.958 --> 00:00:48.958
It's like a...
a sexy goose.

00:00:50.583 --> 00:00:53.375
♪When a humble bard♪

00:00:53.375 --> 00:00:55.333
♪graced a ride along♪

00:00:55.333 --> 00:00:57.833
♪with Geralt of Rivia♪

00:00:57.833 --> 00:00:59.125
♪along came...♪

00:00:59.125 --> 00:01:01.458
Look, I promised to change
the public’s tune about you.

00:01:01.458 --> 00:01:03.125
At least allow me to try.

00:01:03.125 --> 00:01:03.625
Let go.

00:01:03.625 --> 00:01:04.416
Nope. No.

00:01:04.416 --> 00:01:04.916
Let go.

00:01:04.916 --> 00:01:06.166
You horse’s

00:01:06.166 --> 00:01:06.791
arse.

00:01:06.791 --> 00:01:07.666
I just want some
damn peace!

00:01:07.666 --> 00:01:08.625
Well here’s
your peace!

00:01:13.375 --> 00:01:14.875
I said some things to him.

00:01:17.250 --> 00:01:18.333
He’s a...

00:01:19.833 --> 00:01:21.208
A friend?

00:01:26.208 --> 00:01:27.500
Look, why don’t we leave
tomorrow?

00:01:30.333 --> 00:01:32.041
That is if you’ll give
me another chance.

00:01:32.041 --> 00:01:33.500
Why is it whenever I find myself

00:01:33.500 --> 00:01:34.750
in a pile of shit
these days

00:01:34.750 --> 00:01:35.583
it's you

00:01:35.583 --> 00:01:36.375
shovelling it?

00:01:36.541 --> 00:01:37.125
That's not fair.

00:01:37.125 --> 00:01:38.583
The child surprise.

00:01:38.583 --> 00:01:39.708
The djinn.

00:01:39.708 --> 00:01:40.708
All of it.

00:01:40.708 --> 00:01:42.791
If life could give me
one blessing,

00:01:42.791 --> 00:01:44.500
it would be to take you

00:01:44.500 --> 00:01:45.833
off my hands.

00:01:49.875 --> 00:01:51.375
See you around Geralt.

00:02:06.708 --> 00:02:08.916
Fuck it.

